<view class="native-subpage page tcal {{themeClass}}" style="--native-nav-inset:{{navInset}}px;--native-nav-top:{{navTop}}px;--native-nav-row-height:{{navRowHeight}}px;--native-nav-right:{{navRightInset}}px">
  <view class="safe-head"><view class="safe-hbtn" bindtap="back"><native-icon name="back" tone="ink" size="24"></native-icon></view><view class="safe-body"><view class="safe-title-wrap"><text class="safe-title serif">全年天时</text></view></view><view class="safe-spacer"></view></view>
  <scroll-view scroll-y class="generic-scroll"><view class="pad route-body"><view wx:if="{{disabled}}" class="tc-hero"><text class="tc-year serif">全年天时暂不可用</text><text class="tc-sub">命理视角的经营节奏推演已暂停。你的战略判断、军令与复盘不受影响，可继续在参谋室与军师对话。</text></view><block wx:elif="{{!authed}}"><view class="tc-hero"><text class="tc-year serif">看看你全年该攻还是守</text><text class="tc-sub">军师按你的生辰逐月推演经营节奏：哪几个月适合签约扩张、哪几个月该收缩保现金流、拐点在哪。登录后一分钟生成。</text></view><view class="tc-btn login-btn" bindtap="login"><text>登录 · 看我的全年天时</text></view></block><block wx:elif="{{chart}}"><view class="tc-hero"><text class="tc-year serif">{{chart.monthlyOutlook.year}} 年天时日历</text><text class="tc-sub">{{chart.pattern.name}} · 排盘引擎按你的命盘逐月推演{{chart.hourKnown?'':' · 时辰未定，按三柱推演'}}</text><text wx:if="{{chart.current}}" class="tc-now-line">本月（{{chart.nowMonth}}月）：<text class="tc-now-phase">{{chart.current.phase}}</text> —— {{chart.currentHint}}</text></view><view class="tc-grid"><view wx:for="{{chart.months}}" wx:key="month" class="tc-cell {{item.phaseClass}} {{item.turning?'turn':''}} {{item.now?'now':''}}"><text class="tc-m serif">{{item.month}}月</text><text class="tc-p">{{item.phase}}{{item.turning?' · 拐点':''}}</text></view></view><view class="tc-legend"><view class="lg atk"><native-icon name="square" tone="green" size="10"></native-icon><text>进攻月</text></view><view class="lg def"><native-icon name="square" tone="gold" size="10"></native-icon><text>防守月</text></view><view class="lg"><native-icon name="square" tone="neutral" size="10"></native-icon><text>平稳月</text></view><view class="lg turn"><native-icon name="diamond" tone="accent" color-key="{{colorKey}}" size="10"></native-icon><text>拐点提前布局</text></view></view><view class="tc-edit-birth" bindtap="openMingpan"><view class="tc-eb-t"><text>生辰录错了？去命盘报告修改</text><native-icon name="arrow" tone="neutral" size="12"></native-icon></view></view><view wx:if="{{chart.turningMonths}}" class="tc-note card"><text class="tc-nt serif">年度关键节点</text><text class="tc-nd">{{chart.turningMonths}} 是运势转换的拐点月：拐点前后少押重注，提前一个月布局，等势明朗再发力。</text></view><view class="tc-actions"><button class="tc-share" open-type="share" hover-class="none"><text>转发给朋友看他的全年节奏</text></button><view class="tc-imgbtn {{busy?'off':''}}" bindtap="makeImage"><text>{{busy?'生成中…':imgPath?'重新生成图片':'生成天时日历图片 · 存相册/发朋友'}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{imgPath}}" class="tc-result"><image class="tc-img" src="{{imgPath}}" mode="widthFix" show-menu-by-longpress></image><view class="tc-img-acts"><view class="tc-img-act" bindtap="shareImage"><text>发给朋友</text></view><view class="tc-img-act ghost" bindtap="saveImage"><text>保存到相册</text></view></view><text class="tc-img-tip">也可长按图片保存或转发。</text></view></block><block wx:elif="{{loaded}}"><view class="tc-hero"><text class="tc-year serif">先补生辰，看你的全年天时</text><text class="tc-sub">排盘在服务端引擎完成，只算一次长期使用；只用于经营节奏参考。</text></view><view class="tc-form"><view class="pf-opts"><view class="pf-opt {{calendar==='solar'?'on':''}}" data-field="calendar" data-value="solar" bindtap="select"><text>阳历</text></view><view class="pf-opt {{calendar==='lunar'?'on':''}}" data-field="calendar" data-value="lunar" bindtap="select"><text>阴历</text></view></view><view class="tc-date"><input class="pf-input tc-y" type="number" maxlength="4" placeholder="年" data-field="year" bindinput="input"/><input class="pf-input tc-md" type="number" maxlength="2" placeholder="月" data-field="month" bindinput="input"/><input class="pf-input tc-md" type="number" maxlength="2" placeholder="日" data-field="day" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="pf-opts tc-option-row"><view wx:for="{{shichen}}" wx:key="index" class="pf-opt {{hourIdx===item.index?'on':''}}" data-field="hourIdx" data-value="{{item.index}}" bindtap="select"><text>{{item.label}}</text></view></view><view class="pf-opts tc-option-row"><view class="pf-opt {{gender==='male'?'on':''}}" data-field="gender" data-value="male" bindtap="select"><text>男</text></view><view class="pf-opt {{gender==='female'?'on':''}}" data-field="gender" data-value="female" bindtap="select"><text>女</text></view></view><input class="pf-input tc-place" maxlength="20" placeholder="出生城市（选填，用于真太阳时校正）" data-field="place" bindinput="input"/><view class="tc-btn {{valid&&!busy?'':'off'}}" bindtap="saveBirth"><text>{{busy?'排盘中…':'生成我的天时日历'}}</text></view></view></block><canvas canvas-id="tcalCanvas" class="tc-canvas" style="width:600px;height:940px"></canvas><text class="tc-foot">命理内容为文化视角的经营节奏参考，不构成决策依据；「人谋可以改命」。</text><view class="route-bottom-space"></view></view></scroll-view>
  <login-sheet open="{{showLogin}}" reason="profile" bindclose="closeLogin" bindloggedin="loggedIn"></login-sheet>
</view>
